#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:462
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Short cards on these admin screens that point to the matching Pro feature. "
"Turn off to hide them for every site owner; each one can also dismiss a "
"single card. Never shown to %s."
msgstr ""
"Korte kaarten op deze beheerschermen die naar de bijbehorende Pro-functie "
